{21}{Ah, pleased to make your acquaintance, @PCNAME@. My name is Omni Potent and I am in rather dire straights and thought perhaps you could assist me. You see, I am in the employ of Lady Mi as a...provider of pleasures. As such the performance of my...nether regions is quite vital to maintaining the style of living I have grown accustomed to.}{Ah, pleased to make your acquaintance, @PCNAME@. My name is Omni Potent and I am in rather dire straights and thought perhaps you could assist me. You see, I am in the employ of Lady Mi as a...provider of pleasures. As such the performance of my...nether regions is quite vital to maintaining the style of living I have grown accustomed to.}{}{}{}{}
