{23}{Uh-huh. Tell more.}{}{-4}{}{41}{}
{41}{Sadly, as of late my...instrument of income has fallen short of it's...capabilities. To put it bluntly, sir, I can no longer...rise to the occasion.}{Sadly, as of late my...instrument of income has fallen short of it's...capabilities. To put it bluntly, madam, I can no longer...rise to the occasion.}{}{}{}{}
{42}{And you'd like me to do what?}{}{5}{}{61}{}
